Very shocking! A car crashed into a family home in the middle of the night, killing a mother and two children, while a father was seriously injured
(Svay Rieng): At least three people, a mother and her child, were killed when a giant truck drove into their house in the middle of the night at 2:04 AM on March 10, 2019 in Trabek village. Hollow, Ta Sous commune, Svay Chrum district, Svay Rieng province.
According to the report, in the early morning of the 10th, the authorities are intervening to retrieve the bodies of women and two children, as well as bring the husband to the provincial hospital for rescue. As for the car that caused the accident, the police took it to the traffic office to solve it according to the law.
According to eyewitnesses, the victim was a 40-year-old man named Ta, who lived in the upper commune and had a wife and two children. The affected homeowner has a business rather than repairing motorcycles.
Before the incident, there was a 5-wheeler driving from the west, suddenly arrived at the scene where the suspect was asleep, the driver hit the house like lightning to the surprise of the villagers.
At present, the bodies of the victims, mothers and children are being treated by relatives for a traditional ceremony, while her husband is being treated at the provincial hospital. The car was dragged to the provincial traffic office.
Please note that the woman who died in this accident just gave birth a month, which is very sad for this family.
Mr. Pin An, Police Inspector of Svay Chrum District, said that at 3:00 AM, he received information that there was a traffic accident when a car hit the house of a 47-year-old woman named Neang Puta in Trabek Phong village, Ta Suos commune, Svay Chrum district. His forces, in cooperation with the provincial special forces, immediately intervened at the scene, retrieving the bodies of the three mothers and children, and sent the man to the provincial hospital.
Mr. Pin An confirmed that in the case of the accident, the suspect was asleep.
