* First, the cultivation of rice can be done only once, it should be stored for daily use and planting other crops besides rice.
* Second: Ministries, relevant institutions, local authorities at all levels must take measures to maintain good water to supply only for use until normal rainfall.
* Third: Ministries, relevant institutions, local authorities at all levels must be ready to rescue people affected by natural disasters such as wind.
