The suspect was arrested by the Phnom Penh Thmey Administrative Police on the afternoon of March 8, 2019 in front of the Zook Club, 1986 Street, Phnom Penh Thmey Village, Phnom Penh Thmey Sangkat, Sen Sok District, Phnom Penh.
Suspect's name is Pov Chanthy, 37 years old, unreliable occupation, living in Chrey Kong Village, Sangkat Choam Chao, Khan Por Sen Chey. The victim, Lor Bunchhoeun, male, 33 years old, occupation: Zook Club manager, living in Zook Club, 1986 Street, Phnom Penh Thmey Village, Sangkat Phnom Penh Thmey, Khan Sen Sok, Phnom Penh.
