At 3:40 AM, the suspect, Pov Chanthy, arrived in front of the Zook Club in a motodup to take money from the victim, but the victim reported to the new Phnom Penh Post Administration after receiving information from the police. The suspect was brought in for questioning at the Khan Police Inspectorate.
