"Since Kampong Som now has economic potential, through this potential, China will make Kampong Som a financial center with the same development as Singapore," he said. "So it is predicted that in the future, Kampong Som will grow and develop more than Singapore, because we have a port, shipping, trade, so we have nothing to do, we just need to collect money."
