Please be informed that the Cambodian-Cambodian authorities have been discussing to solve the joint problem at this checkpoint well to reach the opening of this gate to the international gate in 2019 as well. Separately, at 10 am on March 8, 2019, tomorrow, the Cambodian-Thai side, led by the two deputy provincial governors, district governors and the Cambodian-Thai military will hold a meeting to resolve some issues to reach the opening of the An Ses port. International doors.
