2: The Ministry of Culture and Fine Arts must organize activities and highlight different and meaningful content in the National Cultural Day event to raise awareness of the true value of national culture through the development of cultural services and products for trade and tourism purposes. .
4: The Ministry of Culture and Fine Arts must have a mechanism to enable Cambodian children to be able to create works that are their new cultural products through training for young people in high schools, universities and general arts organizations / associations to enhance the quality of creators. All new in the form of national culture, dignity and human virtues, avoid completely copying foreign works of art.
5: Samdech supports the theme "Youth for National Culture" which has been selected for the National Cultural Day on March 3, now in the years to come, this is a meaningful topic for all young Cambodians who take the right turn. There is an obligation to preserve, protect and create more positive new works in all areas of all forms of cultural art: Cambodia: the Kingdom of Culture, based on the ancient philosophy, not slow, modern, not foreign.
