For 3 months, CamControl officers in Banteay Meanchey province collected more than 2 tons of damaged goods at the market and burned them.
(Banteay Meanchey): Mr. San Vichea Saravuth, President of CamControl, Banteay Meanchey Branch, and his subordinates on March 6, 2019, in cooperation with provincial trade officials, collected more than 200 kilograms of mixed goods and burned them in Poipet City.
Mr. San Vichea Saravuth said that although Samdech Techo Hun Sen, the Prime Minister of Cambodia, had ordered CamControl officials across the country to withdraw from the border, the Minister of Commerce and the General Camcontrol had given more practical oversight to officials. Before.
Mr. Camcontrol continued that in the first quarter (3 months), professional officers confiscated a total of more than 2 tons of mixed goods in the market, home, stalls in Banteay Meanchey province. In fact, this morning, officials collected more than 200 kilograms of mixed goods and burned them.
Mr. San Vichea Saravuth confirmed that the collection of mixed goods burned: including noodles, orange juice, small and large bottles, noodles, cans, vinegar (acid), milk, soy milk.
Staff and patients at Preah Sihanouk Provincial Referral Hospital are short of water, the provincial commissioner released a water truck to provide water immediately.
(Preah Sihanouk): Preah Sihanouk Provincial Police Commissioner, Major General Chuon Narin, released two water trucks to supply water to the Provincial Referral Hospital immediately after both staff and patients were short of water.
Speaking to Fresh News this afternoon, the General Commissioner confirmed, "This morning, I received a request for intervention from the Provincial Referral Hospital in the lack of clean water for staff and patients. I immediately arranged for the police, fire and rescue to get out of the car to provide clean water to the Sihanoukville Provincial Referral Hospital immediately, which lacks clean water.
He said that two vehicles can fill 10 trucks with water (50 cubic meters) for use in the entire hospital.
Please note that for Sihanoukville, people are not yet able to fully meet the requirements for water use, although the authorities and the Autonomous Water Authority and are working hard.
As China's unique state agenda, the CPPCC has played an important role in China's new development process for nearly 70 years, which has mobilized the national and international people. Formed a driving force for the creation of the miracle of China's subsequent development.
As one of the most populous countries in the world, the Chinese people have many requests, but the Chinese people have a common idea that the great prosperity of the Chinese nation must be achieved. Is the common ideal of nearly 140 million Chinese people.
As an important institution of inter-party cooperation and political dialogue, led by the ruling Chinese Communist Party (CPPCC), it has played an important role in bridging the consensus and forming a common force for the country's development. Nationalism and the resurrection of the nation between the policy makers of Central China and all of China.
Solidarity and democracy are both major topics in the work of the Political Consultative Assembly. The members of the Political Consultative Conference from all walks of life in Chinese society, who are widely represented, also decided that this body could mobilize forces from all walks of life in Chinese society.
As an important part of the Chinese national governance system, "understanding of political advisory and political consulting skills" is an important principle that the Chinese People's Political Consultative Conference and members of the Chinese People's Political Consultative Conference in New must be obeyed while performing the role.
In detail, the members of the People's Political Consultative Conference make proposals to promote the development of the nation, so the challenges in the social and economic development as well as the lives of the people are at the heart of the work of the political advisory body and the members of the Political Consultative Assembly. People of all walks of life.
According to statistics, since the opening of the first session of the 13th CPPCC, a total of 5,360 requests have been received from members of the National People's Congress (NPC), of which 4,567 cases have been officially implemented so far. 99.2% of the requests were resolved by the government.
These proposals are related to the promotion of high-quality economic development, the promotion of political reform, the full implementation of the rule of law, the improvement and guarantee of people's livelihood, and the promotion of peaceful national reunification. Has provided significant assurances and support for the Chinese government to achieve its policies.
People's participatory political consultation is an important image for China's democratization of the people, political dialogue, democratic oversight and political participation and dialogue have fully demonstrated the vital force of socialist democracy.
During their tenure, members of the Chinese People's Political Consultative Conference (CPPCC) at all levels raised comments, criticisms and proposals on the work of the government and administration at all levels in the form of political dialogue, which played a very influential role.
