The Minister of Agriculture requested all stakeholders to strengthen the capacity of farming communities to be agribusiness and to implement contract agricultural production more effectively.
(Phnom Penh): The Minister of Agriculture, Forestry and Fisheries, Mr. Veng Sakhon, on March 6, 2019, requested the leaders and officials at all levels and all relevant NGOs to pay attention to strengthen the capacity of the agricultural community. To be agribusiness and to implement contract agricultural production with high efficiency.
The request of the Minister of Agriculture was made at the opening ceremony of a workshop to disseminate agricultural policies and development plans to more than 40 non-governmental organizations (NGOs) in the field of agriculture, including 23 local NGOs and 17 NGOs. Overseas NGO. The ceremony was held at the Ministry of Agriculture this morning, March 6, 2019.
He stressed the need to work together to promote agricultural diversification, increase value added and potential for crop production, animal husbandry and aquaculture. At the same time, NGOs must strive to continue training and disseminating agricultural technology.
