First, to promote cooperation between the Ministry of Agriculture, Forestry and Fisheries and NGOs that are carrying out tasks related to the agricultural sector.
Second, create opportunities for both sides to meet, communicate, dialogue, increase brotherhood, solidarity, respect and better understanding, and together continue to serve and protect the true interests of the nation, society and the people of Cambodia.
Third, jointly identify the challenges, review the strengths, weaknesses, obstacles, and set the direction for the vision to continue to be more active, comprehensive and highly effective in responding to the real needs of the people, plans and Special National Development Program, Agricultural Development Strategic Plan, National Development Strategic Plan and Rectangular Strategy Phase 4 of the Royal Government.
