Two police officers and nearly 10 accomplices beat a young man to death in Anlong Veng district
(Oddar Meanchey): Two police officers serving in the 905th Border Guard Unit and nearly 10 hippie gang members beat a young man almost to death until he was injured, swollen face, swollen eyes and blood all over his eyes. .
The above violence happened at 8:30 pm on March 3, 2019 in a house showroom in Otameng village, Anlong Veng commune, Anlong Veng district, Oddar Meanchey province. The victim, Khim Kheang, 18, lives in Romchek village, Anlong Veng commune, Anlong Veng district, Oddar Meanchey province.
The defendants of Otameng village, who were involved in the incident, said that the first perpetrator, Ngol Sophorn alias Chamroeun, the second, Dia, was a police officer from the 905th Border Guard Battalion of the Oddar Meanchey Provincial Police, and the other perpetrator was Ran and Nearly 10 other factions did not know their names.
The village guards confirmed that the perpetrators were very vicious police officers. They are the security guards in the village, 4 to 5 people were detained and did not win. He called on the lawyers to take legal action.
The victim said on March 5, 2019 that before the incident, he ate at a housewarming party in the upper commune, while eating, he got up and walked from the table where he was sitting to his friend. Ngol Sophorn, also known as Chamroeun, sat down on the table, and he raised his hand to apologize and help find a new table.
Suddenly, when he went to dance for a while, the police officer jumped in and punched him in the eye, and nearly 10 of his comrades beat him almost to death, almost without the help of the village guards. Will die, lose life.
