(Phnom Penh): The General Secretariat of the National Assembly on March 5, 2019 announced that the National Assembly of Cambodia will elect an official to be a member of the Constitutional Council for a new term for 9 years (2019 to 2028). ).
According to the announcement of the Secretariat of the National Assembly, which was received by Fresh News on the afternoon of March 5, 2019, the Secretariat of the National Assembly will receive applications every morning from 7:00 am. Morning to 11:30 am and evening from 2 pm to 5:30 pm at the Personnel Management Department of the General Department of Administration and Finance of the General Secretariat of the National Assembly. The closing date for applications is March 20, 2019.
