The Minister of Social Affairs said that the current situation of children is better because the children are at least one guardian, still a helpless child, which the state must continue to support and pay more attention to.
At least one or two child care centers are required in community areas. The Royal Government of Cambodia has shifted from providing services in the center to providing children living with their families in the community. Because children living with their families and communities is more caring and supportive and safe than living in the community.
