The speech of Samdech Techo Hun Sen was made on the morning of Tuesday, March 14, 2019, on the occasion of Samdech and Samdech Kittiprittbandit Bun Rany Hun Sen presiding. In celebration of the International Women's Day on March 8, the 108th anniversary at the Koh Pich Center.
