(Phnom Penh): On Tuesday, March 14, 2019, Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia, and His Excellency Dr. Bun Rany Hun Sen, President of the Cambodian Red Cross, invited Presiding over the celebration of the 108th Anniversary of International Women's Day on March 8 at Koh Pich Center.
Samdech Techo commended the Ministry of Women's Affairs, National Council of Cambodia for Women, relevant ministries, institutions, the private sector, civil society and all national and international development partners for their contribution to the improvement of living conditions, rights, status, role, welfare of women and children and the provision of support services. Victims of violence with quality and efficiency.
