The groundbreaking ceremony for the Cambodia-Indonesia Friendship Memorial was held in Baray District, Kampong Thom Province.
(Kampong Thom): In order to strengthen the long-term and long-term friendship between Cambodia and Indonesia, the Indonesian Ambassador to Cambodia, in cooperation with Kampong Thom provincial authorities, laid the groundwork for the construction of a new Cambodia-Indonesia Friendship Memorial. Vieng Chhmor Chrouk Road, next to National Road 6, Doung Village, Ballong Commune, Baray District, Kampong Thom Province.
