Sources from the Kem Sokha Niyum group in the United States say that many of Kem Sokha's supporters abroad, especially in the United States, Canada and France, have increasingly expressed anger over the actions of Sam Rainsy and his party. With Mr. Eng Chai Eang and Mrs. Mu Sochua.
The Kem Sokha faction views the actions of Sam Rainsy and his cronies as increasing pressure on Kem Sokha by constantly heating up the situation, which is Sam Rainsy's intention to shut down. Political path for finding a solution of national reconciliation between Khmer and Khmer.
