According to the Phnom Penh Capital Administration, in order for the 2019 census in Phnom Penh to be successful and have good results, the Phnom Penh Capital Administration would like to make the following recommendations:
* First: All locations, units, institutions or institutions, both public and private, such as hotels, guesthouses, entertainment centers, hospitals, markets, parking lots, ports, airports ... etc. Located in Phnom Penh, must participate and cooperate with the census officer in the census interview at the time of the census night (zero time, March 3, 2019).
In particular, the location of some units that are family, institutions such as pagodas, prisons, dormitories and collection centers ... etc. Located in Phnom Penh, to cooperate and participate with the census officer in interviewing the residents of those institutions or institutions from March 3-13, 2019.
