(Phnom Penh): Samdech Krala Hom Sar Kheng, Deputy Prime Minister and Minister of the Ministry of Interior, on March 2, 2019, answered some questions and questions related to the General Census of the Cambodian People from March 3 to 13, 2019. Coming soon.
"Following my call for all citizens to participate in the nationwide census to be held from March 3 to 13, 2019, I have observed and received some questions as well as related questions. This issue that I would like to clarify as follows:
* First: For the question raised, do Cambodians who are living abroad, especially those who are working abroad, have to return to the country to conduct the census or not?
* Second: For questions related to foreigners, immigrants and non-immigrants living in Cambodia?
I would like to inform our compatriots that for this census, our technical team has prepared questionnaires in many languages, and this work will make us more aware of the number of foreigners of all nationalities living there. On Cambodian territory.
