Senior Minister Kun Kim Closes a Meeting to Summarize Oddar Meanchey Province
(Oddar Meanchey): Senior Minister Kun Kim, Chairman of the Oddar Meanchey Provincial Assistance Team, presided over the closing ceremony of the Oddar Meanchey Provincial Administrative Conference on March 1, 2019.
Mr. Pen Kosal, Governor of Oddar Meanchey Province, highlighted the results of the conference process, which reflected many major achievements of the province in the past year.
Addressing the meeting, Senior Minister Kun Kim expressed his appreciation and appreciation for the participation of officials, civil servants, the Armed Forces and the people in the whole province who have jointly achieved excellent achievements in all areas. Proud.
At the same time, the Senior Minister also reminded the authorities at all levels, the competent forces, the armed forces and the people throughout the province to continue to work together to successfully implement the tasks in 2019, focusing on the following important tasks:
* First: Strengthen peace and political stability, prevent and suppress any activities that affect national security. Employees of civil servants, law enforcement forces and the armed forces must strengthen discipline, statute and improve their ability to perform their duties.
* Second: Maintain security, public order, crack down on and prevent all crimes that occur and take strict measures in the fight against drugs.
* Third: Increase economic development by focusing on agriculture and agro-industry.
* Fourth: Promote the implementation of decentralization and co-decentralization reforms according to the four priorities.
* Fifth: Improve the provision of public services and make more efforts to address local challenges.
