Meaningful Remarks by Samdech Techo Hun Sen at the Groundbreaking Ceremony for Tbong Khmum Provincial Hospital
The Cambodia-China Friendship Hospital Tbong Khmum, which opened today, is the second major hospital project to receive a grant from the Chinese government after the construction of the Cambodia-China Friendship Hospital Preah Kosom: The first construction started in October 2018 recently.
The following are the main words of Samdech Techo Hun Sen:
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the territory of Tbong Khmum province is a painful historical territory related to Samdech's life, such as the struggle against the imperial invasion, the blind place, the place of marriage, the place of sleeping and the place where the first child was born. Died.
* Samdech Techo stated that in addition to the construction of the provincial administration building in Tbong Khmum town also built a university and high school, accommodation for teachers and students and now began to build another large hospital.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Tbong Khmum Provincial Hospital will take 40 months to build. But construction projects by the Chinese government are always ahead of schedule.
* Samdech Techo Prime Minister stated that the territory of Tbong Khmum province is a territory with a history of development since the time of King Preah Kan and during the Sangkum era. However, this territory was also destroyed after the coup d'etat of March 18, 1970, and this territory was also the area where Samdech was blinded and wounded for the fifth time in his battle.
* The head of the Royal Government also stated that the territory of Tbong Khmum province is also the territory where the fighters stood up to liberate the country and build the country from scratch.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen thanked the people in Tbong Khmum province for supporting the resistance movement to overthrow the genocidal regime of Pol Pot. The Prime Minister also thanked the people of Tbong Khmum who voted for the CPP in all terms.
* Samdech Techo stated that voting for the Cambodian People's Party is voting for oneself and maintaining peace in Cambodia.
* The Prime Minister reiterated that he will continue to lead Cambodia for at least another 10 years, because in Cambodia there are still gangs trying to destroy the peace and prosperity of the nation.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen asked what happened after Cambodia was liberated from the genocidal regime and what is now?
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that during his visit to China in January, both the President and the Prime Minister of China mentioned that Samdech Techo was the first guest to visit China in 2019.
* Samdech Techo, Head of the Royal Government, mentioned the relationship between Cambodia and China as a strategic partnership in all aspects and the people have a better relationship. There is nothing wrong with finding relationships in every country in the world. But what Cambodia needs is friends who know how to help each other, especially respect Cambodia's sovereignty.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that based on the relations with China, brought by Samdech Norodom Sihanouk and maintained by the current King of Cambodia, brought about the development of infrastructure, bridges, roads and other buildings such as universities. In Kratie province. This relationship has also brought about various investments that provide employment to no less than half a million Cambodians. In addition, China has built more hydropower plants.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Cambodia needs both aid, loans, concessions and wants investors to come to Cambodia.
* The Prime Minister said that any country in the world needs foreign investment, but it is strange for some Cambodians that Chinese investors come to invest and develop in Cambodia, and Samdech tried to attract Chinese investors to Cambodia. I want to chase them back.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the statement aimed at deterring Chinese investment in Cambodia is a mistake of foreign policy and attracting foreign investment to develop in Cambodia. He added that Cambodia not only welcomes Chinese investment, but also welcomes investors from all over the world.
* The Prime Minister said that at present, Chinese investment is not only in Cambodia, in Vietnam and Latin America, there is also a lot of Chinese investment because China is a rich country.
* Samdech Techo Prime Minister stated that China is also a big market for Cambodia and need to do more to open the market in China.
* Samdech Techo stated that he told the Minister of Agriculture to use the Chinese market 400,000 tons and Vietnam 300,000 tons to solve the problem of falling rice prices in Cambodia.
Through the Chinese Ambassador to Cambodia, Samdech Techo Hun Sen thanked the Chinese government and people for providing nearly $ 50 million for the construction of the Cambodia-China Tbong Khmum Friendship Hospital.
* The Prime Minister stated that Chinese aid has enabled him to implement social protection policies.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the increase in hospitals is to support Samdech's social protection policy for Samdech to achieve its goals.
* Samdech Techo stated that the progress of Cambodia today is not satisfied yet, must work together to continue with the energetic journey.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that in order to continue the journey to progress, the sand must be removed from the feet. In this sense, Samdech refers to corrupt officials who interfere with the development of the nation and the well-being of the people must be removed and punished.
* Samdech Techo stated that Samdech began to implement the fifth approach "surgery", so those who hinder the development, whether star or moon, must be cleared.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen reminded doctors that if there is a good hospital, but doctors lack the ability and care, the service to the people is not good. Samdech Techo advised all doctors to pay attention to provide services to the people.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen calls on people not to panic about rabies. Samdech Techo also called on dog breeders to be vaccinated against rabies.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen announces to civil servants that although there is no income for a year, the Royal Government has money to pay salaries to civil servants and the armed forces. Unlike before to pay the salary to run to the bank.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that along with the salary increase, Cambodia still has money to pay to civil servants in the Armed Forces. Samdech confirmed that the salaries of doctors and teachers are the highest.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Samdech is the longest-serving Prime Minister in the history of Cambodia, who has now held 34 years and will continue for at least another 10 years. Samdech Techo stated that holding sooner or later depends on the support of the people.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen tells the Chinese ambassador that there is still much work to be done together. Through this busy activity, it shows that the relations between Cambodia and China are good.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen declares that he does not support the declaration of independence of Taiwan. Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the Chinese government is well aware of Samdech's policy of adhering to the one-China policy.
* The Prime Minister announced that although he did not support Taiwan's declaration of independence, Cambodia welcomes Taiwanese businesses in Cambodia.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that in recent times, Samdech has spent more than 10 million dollars to build school buildings.
(Phnom Penh): On the fourth day of the official visit of the Army delegation led by Lt. Gen. Hun Manet, Deputy Commander of the Royal Cambodian Armed Forces, Commander of the Army in the People's Republic of China, was received by Lt. Gen. Yuan Yobo. (Yuan Yubo) Commander of the Southern Military Command of China warmly welcomes the Cambodian Army delegation.
The Admiral stated that this is a meeting of good relations that follows the comprehensive strategy of the leaders of the two countries, Cambodia - China to strengthen the relationship between the armies of the two countries. The Admiral confirmed that the Chinese People's Liberation Army will continue to support the Royal Cambodian Armed Forces in building human resources and equipment.
Lt. Gen. Hun Manet expressed his deep gratitude to Admiral Yuan Yubo, Commander of the Southern Military Command of China, for warmly welcoming the Cambodian Army delegation.
The lieutenant general continued that the meeting between the two countries, Cambodia and China, is now to further strengthen the friendship and cooperation between the two countries' armies. The Commander of the Cambodian Armed Forces expressed his deep gratitude to the Chinese government, army and people for their good relations and strong cooperation in the process of building and developing Cambodia.
It should be noted that the official visit of the Cambodian Army delegation to the People's Republic of China ended successfully under the atmosphere of good relations, strong cooperation and all aspects of the two countries.
During the visit and stay in the People's Republic of China, the delegation paid a courtesy call and discussed with senior leaders of the Chinese People's Liberation Army, including members of the State Council and Minister of National Defense of the People's Republic of China. China, vice chairman of the Central Military Commission of the Chinese People's Liberation Army, commander of the Army of the People's Liberation Army and other key leaders.
