Tomorrow morning, Samdech Techo Hun Sen Presides Over the Groundbreaking Ceremony for Tbong Khmum Provincial Hospital
(Tbong Khmum): On Friday, March 1, 2019, Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia, will preside over the groundbreaking ceremony for the construction of the "Cambodia-Cambodia Friendship Hospital". China Gems "worth nearly 50 million US dollars with Chinese aid. Chinese Ambassador to Cambodia Wang Winthean will also attend the ceremony.
The Cambodia-China Friendship Hospital Tbong Khmum, which will open tomorrow, is the second major project funded by the Chinese government after the Cambodia-China Friendship Hospital Preah Kosom: The first construction started in October 2018 recently.
Tbong Khmum Cambodia-China Friendship Hospital will be built on an area of 24,300 square meters on a total area of 55,815 square meters. This project is built in 40 months. The hospital will cost about 310,000,000 yuan ($ 45,660,000). The hospital will be spacious and equipped with state-of-the-art medical equipment.
The new hospital will be a regional hospital covering the population of Kratie, Ratanakkiri, Stung Treng and Mondulkiri provinces. The new large hospital needs an additional 456 skilled staff.
Please be reminded that Tbong Khmum is a newly established province, cut from Kampong Cham on December 30, 2013. All infrastructure is new.
Tbong Khmum Provincial Health Department has 998 health workers, including 467 women, 6 referral hospitals, 68 health centers and 2 health posts covering 843,310 people.
