Mr. Chhim Phalvarun clarified to the media again in a conference after the first half-year meeting of the Supreme Advisory Council held at the Peace Palace under the chairmanship of Samdech Techo Hun Sen on the 28th This February 2019.
Mr. Chhim Phalvarun stated that: "Regarding the irregularities in the implementation of the Supreme Court Judgment on January 24, Samdech Techo expressed his dissatisfaction, as stated by the Supreme Council. "The important point is that there must be an investigation, and Samdech Techo also gave instructions to Samdech Picheay Sena to check the characteristics caused by the provincial army, if any problems are found, there must be a removal."
He continued, "And if there is any involvement with the provincial board of governors, if any problems are found, Samdech has already confirmed, and now reiterates that from the district governor level to the deputy provincial governor, Samdech needs only 15 minutes if As the provincial governor, the Royal Decree of Samdech takes two hours, so it is a confirmation of the law and that Samdech has made a series of firm decisions without allowing his subordinates to underestimate his actions. ”
On January 24, 2019, a joint force in Sihanoukville, including the military police and military officers, led by the prosecutor and a deputy governor, executed the Supreme Court ruling in the land dispute in Koki village, Bit Trang commune. Prey Nob District, Preah Sihanouk Province. The incident led to clashes, refueling, burning tires, blocking roads and throwing stones, and some residents were arrested.
General Sao Sokha, Deputy Commander of the Royal Cambodian Armed Forces and Commander of the National Gendarmerie, decided to set up a commission to investigate the case. After this investigation, the National Gendarmerie decided to impose administrative discipline on five Gendarmerie officers and one military officer, two of whom were to file a case to be sent to court.
The Secretary General of the Supreme Advisory Council, who held a conference to present the results of the meeting, stated that during the meeting of the Supreme Advisory Council, Samdech Techo Hun Sen not only ordered an investigation into the perpetrators, but also ordered Investigate the people behind it as well.
"The investigation is already underway, led by General Sao Sokha," he said. The investigation into those behind it is ongoing. Only then did Samdech confirm to Samdech Pichey Sena, who is the head of the military, to examine the problem of the Deputy Commander of Kampong Som province, if it is found, action must be taken. ”
Mr. Chhim Phalvarun further stated that Samdech had already stated that the use of military force in the implementation of this verdict was not in the nature of a judicial police force, could only be used by the police and the military, and stated that when soldiers were used, Used in case of war and other important issues. When the country was peaceful, Samdech used soldiers to help the people. Therefore, Samdech made it clear to Samdech Pichey Sena.
Regarding the land issue in Sihanoukville, Samdech Techo Hun Sen ordered Deputy Prime Minister Chea Sophara, Minister of Land Management, Urban Planning and Construction, and Minister of Agriculture, Mr. Veng Sakhon, to examine the legal aspects of how to manage state land. How to provide social land to people who actually live on that land as well. ABC Extrastot sponsors newlyweds's trip to Russia
