(Battambang): Battambang Provincial Administration this morning, February 27, 2019, organized the opening ceremony of the meeting to summarize the work results of 2018 and raise the direction of work for the implementation of 2019 under the chairmanship of Mr. Nguon Rattanak, Governor of Battambang, Mr. Uy Ri, Chairman of the Provincial Council and Major General Ek Sam Oun, Acting Commander and Chief of Staff of the 5th Military Zone.
