Mr. Hal Sarath said this during a meeting with stakeholders on the posting of voter list locations and voter registration, hierarchical confirmation and submission to the NEC at the NEC Conference Hall this morning. This February 25th.
The date for voter registration must start from March 4 to 27, 2019, during which time it is divided into two phases: Phase 1: The voter registration phase at the Commune / Sangkat Hall lasts for 13 days. Days excluding Sundays and holidays set by the Royal Government and Phase 2: Submit the list of names prepared from the commune / sangkat according to the hierarchy (from the commune to the municipality, district, Khan and then to the NEC) ) Which lasts for 7 days.
