The "Sea Sankranti" event will be held for 3 days from 14 April to 16 April 2019 at Independence Beach with a trade tourism exhibition with local product booths, food booths and tour booths. Which shows the potential and development of Sihanoukville.
The "Sea Sankranti" event will feature various religious and cultural ceremonies, including the traditional Buddhist counting of bowls by inviting monks, the reception of deities, and the lighting of lanterns.
In particular, in the whole event, there will be many different entertainment programs different from other events with beautiful creative ideas associated with the potential of Sihanoukville, in which the gate is decorated with large lobster. .
A variety of entertainment events will be held, including large-scale contemporary concerts featuring celebrities, as well as cultural screenings featuring joint performances by ancient and contemporary artists.
In addition, beach activities will include circus performances, popular Khmer games such as throwing a box, beating a pot, pulling a pole, jumping on a fire pole, playing hide and seek on the beach, and hiding towels. .
