Residents said that a stream in the middle of the village, if there is a dam or sluice can be used up to three villages: Romchek, Romchek East and Romchek West in Anlong Veng commune, Anlong Veng district. Every year, the water of this stream is always flowing and clear and easy to use, but this year, due to the drought, the water in the stream is dry and the water in the stream cannot be used.
Citizens said that this is why they decided to raise their hands to call on the Minister of Water Resources to build dams or sluice gates for them to have enough water and irrigation to serve their livelihood. To the people of these three villages who are experiencing drought and lack of water.
