(Banteay Meanchey): Mr. San Xian Ho, Governor of Poipet City, on February 24, 2019, led many subordinates, including 200 people, to bury the foundation stone of Preah Vihear size 6 meters by 11 meters at a cost of 60,000 Dollars at Wat Wat Khem Seimaram (Tumnup K5) located in Tumnup K5 village, Sangkat Poipet, Poipet city to be a place for Buddhists to worship near and far.
