* Traveling by train is a tradition of the Kim family.
Rail travel has been a tradition of the Kim family since the time of Kim Jong Un's grandfather, Kim Il-sung. Founder and former North Korean leader Kim Il-sung traveled by train on a long journey to Eastern Europe in 1984. Kim's father, Kim Jong Il, also took a train to Moscow in 2001.
