(Phnom Penh): The President of the Cambodian Red Cross Branch in Phnom Penh, Mr. Khuong Sreng, said that the humanitarian donations of the philanthropists who support the Cambodian Red Cross in Phnom Penh must be given to the victims and the vulnerable can not take the money or These gifts go to sponsors for the staff of the Red Cross.
