The meeting also discussed the revenue and expenditure of the Red Cross, the organization of human resource training, especially the training of Red Cross youth, which in 2019, the Capital Red Cross will be recruited 3,000 people to serve humanitarian activities such as First aid, dissemination of road traffic laws and education related to drug problems.
Mr. Khuong Sreng continued that the funds used for humanitarian activities must be used to target the philanthropists in accordance with the high recommendation of Samdech Kittipritthbandit Bun Rany Hun Sen, President of the Cambodian Red Cross.
