Regarding the decision of the pagoda committee, Mr. Hang Pov added that it shows the participation of monks in the field of heritage, as well as the participation in the work of preserving the heritage of monks. To facilitate the relocation, the APSARA Authority will facilitate the arrangement of the monk's place as well as the bathroom.
