CPAC cement truck driver crashes into Indian motorbike and tricycle, killing one teacher and injuring four
(Phnom Penh): On the morning of February 22, 2019, the Office of the Road Traffic Police of the Phnom Penh Municipal Police sent the perpetrator, 48-year-old Prum Bunnath, a car driver living in CPAC, who neglected to hit a motorbike. Four motorcycles and an Indian tricycle caused the death of a teacher and injured a total of four people (two women) to go to court for investigation and legal charges.
The victim, 49-year-old Sok Shell, a teacher at Boeung Trabek High School in Sangkat Mittapheap, Khan 7 Makara, Phnom Penh, was born in Srey Santhor district, Kampong Cham province. And also bring the body back to his hometown.
Due to this accident and will continue to be criticized for allowing trucks and cement trucks to enter the city at the wrong time, administration and wrong lanes, Phnom Penh Governor Mr. Khuong Sreng and Phnom Penh Municipal Police Commissioner Lt. Gen. Thet. The police also seized several cement trucks yesterday.
Mr. Pen Khun, Deputy Director of the Land Traffic Office of the Phnom Penh Municipal Police, told Fresh News that the Phnom Penh Governor and the General Commissioner had ordered the traffic police to arrest all cement trucks driving into Phnom Penh at the wrong time. And wrong lanes set by the Phnom Penh Capital Administration.
According to Mr. Pen Khun, after receiving this strict order, the Phnom Penh traffic police force, in cooperation with the relevant authorities, arrested 10 cement trucks that violated Chbar Ampov in Chbar Ampov district. He said the operation would continue like a thunderstorm to enforce the law effectively.
Apparently, after his arrest, Mr. Pen Khun went to educate, disseminate and fine according to the law. He added that if there is a next time, more serious measures will be taken, and he claimed that due to the large number of construction sites in Phnom Penh, the permission for the cement truck to enter has been clearly defined, both in terms of time and route, ie can not leave. Enter at will.
