Chinese nationals met with a traffic accident in Prey Nob district, Preah Sihanouk province, but when the police went to measure and found drugs, 5 people were arrested and confiscated 156 packs of drugs
(Preah Sihanouk): A traffic accident occurred between a small car and a large truck parked on the sidewalk at 3:45 am on February 21, 2019 on National Road No. 4 points: Ta Nei village, Ta Nei commune, Prey Nob district, Preah Sihanouk province.
After receiving this information, the administrative police force of Ta commune, Prey Nup district, immediately inspected the case while measuring the scene and found 3 Chinese nationals, one of whom was carrying a long bag of something out of it. The car crashed and walked away from the scene.
Suddenly, the suspect followed the police, dropped the bag and fled, but was chased by the police and confiscated eight large packages of drugs, while the two accomplices ran into the forest and disappeared. After a while, another car arrived at the scene with three suspects in it and drove quickly towards Sihanoukville, even though the Prey Nup District Police Inspectorate barricaded it and refused to stop.
At this time, the police chased the car, stopped the two of them and ran into the forest, then it continued to move forward, but was caught by the specialized force near Wat Smach Deng in Smach Deng village, Ream commune, Prey Nob district, confiscated drug exhibits 16 packs.
After being interrogated by the Anti-Drug Bureau in accordance with the procedures and orders of the Sihanoukville Provincial Police Commissioner, Major General Chuon Narin proceeded to arrest three more accomplices in Sihanoukville with evidence of drug seizures. 132 small packages.
According to the report, during the operation, the police confiscated a total of 156 packages of white crystalline powder suspected to be drugs (08 large packages and 148 small packages), 3 mobile phones, 1 car, 2 drug scales and Some other drug packaging materials. Currently, the competent authorities are building a case to proceed with the procedure.
