(Preah Sihanouk): The National Committee for Coastal Management and Development of Cambodia and Preah Sihanouk Provincial Administration on February 21, 2019 held a meeting to disseminate and implement the plan to build entertainment stalls along Ochheuteal 1 Beach, Sihanoukville Province. Sihanoukville.
