(Phnom Penh): 140 houses donated by Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia and Samdech Kittipritthbandit Bun Rany Hun Sen will be handed over to Cambodian veterans in Banteay Meanchey province on February 25, 2019.
These 140 houses are located in Poi Char commune, Phnom Srok district, Banteay Meanchey province. On February 21, 2019, Senior Minister Kun Kim, Secretary General of the Cambodian Veterans Association, inspected all the houses.
Mr. Kun Kim said that all these houses were a gift from Samdech Techo and Samdech Kittipritthbandit to veterans who are living in poverty. According to Kun Kim, in addition to providing houses for accommodation, the Royal Government also provides land as a policy for them to grow crops.
