Kandal provincial police confirmed that after questioning the officers, they found out that the two trucks were dependent on Mr. Ul Bunna, the deputy commissioner in charge of fire trucks, then the deputy commissioner ordered Mr. To Soeun, the director of the office. Prevent and extinguish fires.
