This morning, the General Commission of the National Police held a meeting to review the work results in 2018 and raise the direction for 2019.
(Phnom Penh): In the morning of February 21, 2019, the General Commission of the National Police organized a meeting to evaluate the situation and the results of operations in 2018 and disseminate the direction of the Ministry of Interior in 2019.
The conference was chaired by General Dr. Neth Savoeun, National Police Commissioner General, and was attended by the Deputy National Police Commissioner, the Director of the Capital-Provincial Commission, and the relevant police leaders. The ceremony took place at the Ministry of Interior.
