Mr. Vathorn said that the gathering at this time with a happy face is due to the fact that our country is peaceful, if our country is not peaceful, we do not have the opportunity to gather to celebrate with Like now.
Meak Bochea is celebrated on the 15th day of the month of Meak every year for two purposes: First, to commemorate the day of the Quadrangle Conference, which the Buddha declared the establishment of Buddhism in the world in India in 588 BC. The 15th day of the month of Meak, only nine months after his enlightenment, and the second: to commemorate the age of his Nirvana.
The formation of Buddhism as a religious organization took place among 1,250 monks, members of a convention that brought together people from all walks of life. At that convention, the Buddha preached 11 principles for all members of the convention to adopt as a way of life and to spread the word about Buddhism to others.
As for the declaration of the age of entering the Nirvana of Samma Samputa, he made it according to the adoration (request) of the devil (giant). According to Dr. Heng Mony Chenda's book "Understanding Meak Bochea" about the Devil's devotion, the Devil said to the Samma Samputa: Now is the time for the demise of the Almighty. ”
The Samma Samputa told Ananda, "Mnal Anand, when the Devil said this, I said this to the Devil," The devil has a sinful heart. Tathagata Not long ago, three months from today, Tathagata will have passed away. Mnal Anand today, I have the conscience to put the age of Sangkha in the field of the stupa just now.
(Kampong Thom): Major General Som Sun, Commander of Kampong Thom Military Operation Area and President of the Provincial Cambodian Veterans Association, on February 19, 2019, led the provincial-district-commune colleagues of the Kampong Thom Provincial Committee of the Cambodian Veterans Association. Local authorities and residents handed over the 113rd house, a gift from Samdech Techo Hun Sen, to Sorn Vin, a war-disabled veteran with an inadequate housing.
Major General Som Sun brought a message from Samdech Techo Hun Sen and Samdech Kittiprittbandit, who always thought of our veterans all over the country.
In fact, Samdech has now handed over a new house to our veterans, who have sacrificed their flesh and blood to the point of disability in contributing to national unity for complete peace and development of the country as it is today.
Key remarks by Samdech Techo Hun Sen on the occasion of meeting with more than 10,000 workers in Ang Snoul district, Kandal province
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that he was very happy with the current situation in the labor sector, which has improved from a salary of more than $ 40 during 1997 to about $ 182 in 2019.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the Royal Government is not only considering raising the wages of workers and raising the salaries of civil servants in the Armed Forces, but also considering macroeconomics, especially preventing the rise in commodity prices. .
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that if wages are raised, but the price of goods goes up, then the increase in wages and salaries will not make sense.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen also expressed his satisfaction with the stability of the riel. Samdech Techo Hun Sen advised the National Bank to pay attention to the exchange rate fluctuations.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the presence of factories in Kandal and other provinces is a success of the factory deployment policy, which is now 20 years old.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that during the Sangkum Reastr Niyum era, His Majesty King Norodom Sihanouk tried very hard to establish a school, but did not respond enough, so Samdech migrated at a young age to study in Phnom Penh. But now more schools are being built more and closer to people's homes.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the Royal Government of Cambodia has set out the country's development vision step by step. Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Samdech has been deep with farmers for about 30 years, but for the past three years he has been deep with workers.
* The Prime Minister stated that when Samdech became the Prime Minister in 1985, Samdech began to work closely with farmers, and officials, whether officials in the country, even officials had to work abroad.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that this year Cambodia has up to 6 million tons of rice left. However, the goal of exporting 1 million tons of rice per year has not been achieved yet due to strong partners such as Vietnam and Thailand.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the Royal Government is currently working to put in place policies to reduce farmers' cultivation and rice production to a minimum. The government will also try to connect electricity to water sources to help farmers use the electricity to pump water instead of machines.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen also encouraged the production of fertilizers in the country to make fertilizers cheaper to facilitate the cultivation of lower prices. Samdech Techo stated that only by lowering the cost of production can Cambodia be able to compete with other rice exporters.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen also urged relevant officials to work hard to maintain the old market and find new markets for Cambodian rice while rice has a good reputation.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen also showed the Royal Government's efforts to attract investors to invest in both agriculture and industry to create more products for export and create jobs for people.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen told the Ministry of Agriculture to advise people not to grow sugarcane according to market prices. For example, when they see the price of rubber growing, when they see the price of cashews rising, they cut down the rubber, they plant cashews, when they see the price of mango growing, they cut down the cashew trees .... Samdech Techo said that doing so is a danger that requires consideration.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen presented a plan to taste coffee at a shop to know the taste of coffee that Cambodians are popular, but Samdech forbade the authorities to ban other people.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Cambodia welcomes all investors from all countries to do business under the umbrella of peace and adherence to a liberal, democratic, multi-party political system.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen thanked all the people and workers who voted for the CPP as well as for Samdech as Prime Minister.
* Samdech Techo, the head of the Royal Government, said that the election for the Cambodian People's Party is a vote to protect peace and support democracy in Cambodia.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the Cambodian People's Party belongs to the people, serves the people, lives with the people, never runs away from the people.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen asked the people to note that Samdech has no foreign nationality, no home abroad, so Samdech has no day to flee abroad, he is still biting the grass to live with the people.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen reminded that, of course, Samdech had fled the district in 1977, but the escape at that time was to build a force to liberate the country, not to run alone. Samdech Techo said that at that time, Samdech was able to flee to a third country to be safe alone, but Samdech did not run away from the Cambodian people and his wife.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen told workers that as long as they are paid and have a job, do not worry about anyone saying anything. Samdech Techo Hun Sen said that now there are a lot of people making statements as a psychological war, but Samdech is happy that workers, people are not shocked by all the inspiration.
* In this morning's meeting, Samdech Techo Hun Sen also reminded to pay attention to the well-being of workers in the factory by building the right food place and hospital. At the same time, employers and workers must know how to discuss and resolve some issues. Samdech Techo reminded factory owners that measures to lay off workers are not the right solution.
* Samdech Techo Prime Minister reminded that without peace, there can be no factory presence in Cambodia.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen once again called on parents and the public not to discriminate against LGBT people.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen called on LGBT people to help prevent the spread of various diseases, especially HIV to others. The call comes after reports that homosexual HIV rates are on the rise.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen continues to call on all authorities to solve the problem of water shortage for people who lack water.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the establishment of the Supreme Council and Advisory, composed of political parties without seats in the National Assembly, in order to find inputs to solve social problems.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that during the global economic crisis in 2008-2009, some factories in Cambodia were closed, but the Royal Government immediately resolved to keep jobs for the people.
* The Prime Minister has stated that he will not allow any factory in Cambodia to close. On February 29, 2019, there will be a discussion in a forum between the state and the private sector to address the challenges of investors.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Cambodia earned about $ 180 million from visas, which is non-tax revenue from foreign tourists.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that so far he has raised about $ 500,000 to set up a group of lawyers to defend poor women. Samdech Techo confirmed that this budget is not the national budget, it is Samdech's own budget. Samdech Techo confirmed that the defense team for this poor woman has about 50 members, along with one locomotive and four deputies.
* Samdech Techo appealed to all workers, when there is a lawsuit, to take Samdech's lawyers to defend themselves free of charge.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen warns the opposition that no one in Samdech's family has a mental illness, they are very long-lived and do not die easily
* The Prime Minister said that the strategy of leading the country is not easy for anyone to know, turn left or turn right, no one knows, this is a difficulty that the opposition does not know Samdech.
