WASHINGTON (Reuters) - US President Donald Trump on Tuesday said trade talks with China were going well and hinted that the United States may delay the escalation of hostilities. Taxes due beyond March 1. This is according to a quote from the Russian newspaper Sputnik on Wednesday afternoon, February 20, 2019.
Trump made the remarks after a delegation of US officials visited Beijing last week to attend US-China trade talks, with the next round to be held in Washington. This Thursday and Friday.
China and the United States have been embroiled in a trade war since Donald Trump announced in June 2018 that $ 50 billion worth of Chinese goods imported into the United States would be taxed. Twenty-five percent aim to try to close the US-China trade deficit.
Since then, the two world economies have announced tariff increases until the G20 summit in Argentina in December last year, with Trump and Chinese President Xi Jinping agreeing on a moratorium. Temporary tax war between the two countries to allow a chance for negotiations to find a new trade agreement, while the suspension will expire on March 1.
Military officers, students and trainees who come to study and teach at the National Defense University must be absolutely loyal to the motherland and the legitimate Royal Government born from the election led by Samdech Techo
(Phnom Penh): The National Defense University strives to train students and trainees to become capable soldiers, loyal to the motherland and the legitimate Royal Government.
In fact, on the morning of February 20, 2019, the University announced the implementation of the decision on the internal regulations and professional ethics of professors, military professors, staff, students and trainees 2019-20020, which is divided into 4 chapters and 59 articles. Page.
General Professor Chea Dara, Personal Adviser to Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia in charge of the Rector of the National Defense University, stated that the internal regulations and professional ethics are established for two purposes:
* First: Increase the efficiency and effectiveness of training and training aimed at students and trainees to become an army capable of leading the defense of the motherland against the rebel movement, the color revolution movement with the character of trying to overthrow the government and become a force. A truth that is absolutely loyal to the motherland, protects the Constitution, protects the King, protects the legitimate Royal Government led by Samdech Techo Hun Sen as Prime Minister.
* Second: Participate successfully in the implementation of the Royal Cambodian Armed Forces Reform Plan, Political Program and Rectangular Strategic Plan of the Royal Government, especially the motto 2: Internal reform, increase external affairs in the spirit of independence and the five approaches: mirror or Water, scrub, treatment and surgery.
General Chea Dara said that the university also agreed to include in the strategic plan to build and strengthen the National Defense University for two main purposes:
1: National Defense University as a training ground for human resources in the field of national defense and second: a center for orientation on the position of national defense policy in accordance with the words of Samdech Techo Prime Minister "The army is the defense of the people" .
The Rector said that this decision is very important in terms of internal regulations, professional ethics, leadership, management, leadership, intellectuals, military professors, staff, academics, students and trainees to improve the quality and efficiency of student work, skills and research. And trainees at the National Defense University.
He urged students and trainees to remember some special points, which are their duties and responsibilities as a whole in the National Defense University, to be absolutely loyal to the motherland, to protect the Constitution, to protect the King, to protect the legitimate government led by Samdech Techo. Hun Sen is the Prime Minister of Cambodia.
