He added that today, the two partners organized a workshop focused on sharing experiences with Cambodian students to share tips on how to get a scholarship. This seminar is the best preparation for Cambodian students because in the past, many students did not get much information about this scholarship.
He added that for scholarships to study in China, it is not required that only students know Chinese, because there are two types of scholarships: 1: study in Chinese and 2: study in English, which means students who Want to study in China, only know English can get a scholarship.
