Lieutenant Colonel Rith Sona, Deputy Inspector of Chey Sen District, Preah Vihear Province, said that today, Saang Commune Chief and the school principal handed over the humanitarian donation of Major General Sous Sok Dara to Men Chhin, a widow. Poor people live in the upper commune.
