Mr. Ek Sam Ol added that 2019 is also the beginning of a new kilometer of the era of Cambodian-Chinese relations on the adaptation of the One Belt, One Road and Rectangular Strategies. He said that Chinese investors and tourists join the Royal Government of Cambodia in developing the Cambodian economy and further strengthening the ties of friendship and friendship between the two nations that have existed since ancient times.
