(Phnom Penh): The National Bank of Cambodia, Svay Rieng Branch has inaugurated a new building in the center of Svay Rieng and officially announced this morning, February 18, 2019.
The inauguration of the new building was attended by Mr. Chea Chanto, Governor-General of the National Bank of Cambodia, Mr. Men Vibol, Governor of Svay Rieng Province, as well as several National Bank officials.
According to the Director of the National Bank of Svay Rieng Branch, the building of the National Bank of Svay Rieng Branch, which was officially inaugurated today, is a modern building with high technology and high security system.
