Mr. Men Vibol expressed his happiness, congratulations and considered that this new achievement confirms the growth and growth of the national banking sector, but also contributed to enhance the image of Svay Rieng province even more beautiful.
Mr. Chea Chanto said that the new branch building of the National Bank of Cambodia in Svay Rieng province will provide another important message to serve the National Bank sector in Cambodia, especially for the whole territory of Svay Rieng to grow and develop. More.
Mr. Chea Chanto stated that the construction of this new building is to respond to the development of the economic sector of Svay Rieng province and the need to manage and coordinate monetary operations, as well as to promote the riel more widely.
