Credit Bureau of Cambodia and AMK Microfinance Institution Collaborate to Provide Financial Health Monitoring Services
(Phnom Penh): The Cambodian Credit Bureau (CBC) and the microfinance institution AMK have collaborated on the provision of financial health monitoring services. This collaboration took place on February 15, 2019 with the participation of Mr. Oeur Sothearoth, Chief Executive Officer of the Credit Bureau of Cambodia (CBC), Mr. Kea Boran, Chief Executive Officer of AMK Microfinance Institution.
Provision of Financial Health Monitoring Service This service has been launched through AMK Microfinance Institution branch since January 2, 2019.
Mr. Oeur Sothearoth said that during the more than 6 years of operation, CBC has started and focused on customer credit reports, which allows members to better understand their clients and make effective and responsible credit decisions. Correct.
He added that in addition, the system also helps general customers to request and better understand their credit information, which will help them to prepare for loan applications. As for the stability of the financial sector and the economy.
He added that the Financial Health Monitoring Service is a service of the CBC, which allows the general public to review their credit reports or access to credit on their own through CBC Strategic Partners.
He stated that in order to use this service, customers just need to bring the original and valid ID card or passport and go to all 5 branches of AMK MFI, such as head office, Khan Por Senchey, Sangkat Choam Chao 3, Kampong Cham, Kandal and provincial branches. Siem Reap.
Mr. Kea Boran said, “AMK is pleased to partner with the Cambodian Credit Bureau (CBC) to provide a wide range of financial health monitoring services to Cambodians by requesting to review their personal credit reports at branches. "AMK Microfinance Institution."
He added that AMK currently serves more than 760,000 customers and has branches covering all districts and communes across the country. Therefore, this financial service will help customers to understand their financial situation, improve financial knowledge and be ready responsibly to get a loan from a financial institution.
