BEIJING, Feb. 15 (Xinhua) - China and the United States will hold a series of high-level economic and trade talks in the sixth round on Friday to discuss ways to boost economic and trade ties. Finished in Beijing.
Xi Jinping hopes that the bilateral working group can adhere to the principles and directions set by him and US President Trump, increase communication, focus on cooperation, as well as manage and resolve differences properly. Promote economic and trade cooperation between China and the United States and the development of strong and stable relations between the two countries.
