(Phnom Penh): The nationwide traffic law enforcement campaign for February 16, 2019, the traffic police force inspected 5,806 vehicles and found 1,025 vehicles violating the law (60% motorcycles), 405 education vehicles and parks. 620 fines, according to the official report of the Traffic Police and Public Order Department of the General Commission of the National Police.
