Kampong Cham Provincial Governor: Concerned about the people complained to the upper level after the implementation of the good service competition of commune officials
(Kampong Cham): In announcing the results of the 2018 Commune / Sangkat Service Competition in Kampong Cham Province, which was held at Kampong Cham Provincial Hall on the afternoon of February 15, 2019, Kampong Cham Provincial Governor Mr. Kouch Chamroeun He said that he was worried about the people complaining to the service level after the implementation of the service competition for the people of the commune in Kampong Cham province so far.
The Deputy Governor continued that in order to improve the quality of public services at the local level, Kampong Cham Provincial Administration has issued Decision No. 072/18 US on the establishment of the Commune / Sangkat Competition Evaluation Committee. Good service in Kampong Cham province.
Based on the Rectangular Strategy Phase 4 of the Royal Government, the 6th Legislature of the National Assembly and in accordance with the reform policy of the Royal Government of Cambodia, focusing on the reform of the provision of public services at the sub-national level, which is defined to serve the people. Better for the welfare of the people and the prosperity of our country with transparency, efficiency and effectiveness based on the principles of good governance.
The Provincial Administration has launched the Commune / Sangkat Competition for Good Service of Kampong Cham Province, requiring all 109 Commune / Sangkat Administration Officers to implement essential public services to provide local people with public services such as: Birth registration, marriage registration, death registration, registration of permanent residence A1, provision of residence book A2, registration of family A3 and provision of family book A4.
According to Mr. Han Kosal, in the implementation of the Commune / Sangkat Competition for the Good Service of the Commune / Sangkat Administration in Kampong Cham Province in 2018, there has been a strong participation from Commune / Sangkat Chiefs, Commune / Sangkat Clerks, Commune / Sangkat Administration Police Chiefs. And citizens.
The activities of the Commune / Sangkat Administration in providing services to people's homes have been posted on Facebook and have the support of many local people and on Facebook.
As a result, the first ranked commune was Prek Krabao commune, Kang Meas district, in which the total score was 39,171 points and received a bonus of 10 million riels. The second place went to Mesor Chrey commune, Stung Trang district with a total score of 33,718 points received an incentive of 6 million riels. The third place went to So Kong commune, Kang Meas district with a total score of 31,366 points and received an incentive of 4 million riels.
At the same time, the Governor of Kampong Cham Province, Mr. Kouch Chamroeun, instructed all Commune / Sangkat officials to continue their efforts to serve the people better in 2019, especially the winning communes. Strive to keep your belt well.
