Prior to the announcement of the proceedings, Sam Rainsy, the head of the National Salvation Movement, declared that he was the only person who had urged the EU to impose sanctions on Cambodia after his successful coup d'état. The name of the CNRP that the court dissolved from Mr. Kem Sokha.
