Samdech Techo Hun Sen added: "His Excellency Prak Sokhon, during his visit to the joint commission meeting between Cambodia and Myanmar, also discussed with Mrs. Aung San Suu Kyi and the leaders of Myanmar on this issue because they threatened the same. "Let me talk about this, so what I want to say is that we have to work hard."
The head of the Royal Government of Cambodia added that at this point, all Cambodians, especially workers, for next week, as the Prime Minister of Cambodia, will continue to visit workers to say that if there is still work. Make money, do not care who says nothing.
Samdech Techo Hun Sen also stressed that Cambodia does not trade national sovereignty and independence for any aid or issue. Even without additional income, Cambodia is able to pay civil servants 'salaries for up to a year, as only customs revenue is sufficient to pay civil servants' salaries.
In addition, Cambodia's strongmen also called on workers and civil servants not to worry about the EBA as long as the work continues and the removal of the EBA is killing the opposition. He also claimed that he was waiting to see the people who said that Cambodia died because of the withdrawal of the EBA.
