Raise 2 stars to 3 Deputy Commissioners of Phnom Penh and appoint new Meanchey District Inspector, Mr. Meng Vimean Dara to replace Mr. Teng Sino
(Phnom Penh): On the morning of February 15, 2019, three Phnom Penh Deputy Police Commissioners were promoted to the rank of Major General (2 stars) and announced the appointment of a new Meanchey District Police Inspector, Mr. Meng Vimean Dara, to replace Mr. Teng Sino. To retire.
