The following are the important remarks of Samdech Techo Hun Sen:
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen praised and appreciated the efforts of all civil servants and police forces who worked hard for the benefit of the nation and the people.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen also praised the efforts of the police force to protect security, order and peace, which seeks to destroy the extremists and some biased circles. In particular, efforts were made to make the 6th National Assembly election process a success.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen reminds the police force to continue to maintain security, order, peace, sovereignty, water integrity and resolutely oppose any color revolution.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen also reminded the relevant officials to make efforts to provide services more effectively. Prevent trafficking, use of equipment, prevent fishing offenses ....
* Samdech Prime Minister continues to cooperate with the authorities and authorities of neighboring countries to crack down on terrorism, crime, technology and all kinds of transnational crime
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen urges the prevention of immigrants by land, sea, air and strict control of foreigners in Cambodia.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen requested all ministries, institutions and stakeholders to participate in the election of the Capital and Provincial Councils in accordance with the law in May.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen urges attention to the provision of public services to make this service faster and more efficient.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen calls on the authorities and forces to be ready to deliver water to the people in the dry season this year, when the country faces hot weather.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen instructs the Ministry of Health to pay attention to fighting various diseases.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen requested the authorities and the police force to work together to promote the economy to strengthen national independence and national sovereignty.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen said that people and people do not care about what others say if they can continue to pay their salaries and be able to eat normally.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Cambodia continues to have good cooperation with the European Union without compromising the EBA on Cambodian-EU relations.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen calls on companies from all European countries to continue their business and live happily under the shadow of Cambodia's peace.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen also called on all investors and business people to continue to believe in doing business in Cambodia as Cambodia is reforming many other services to facilitate business.
* The Prime Minister expressed his belief that through these reforms, the investment climate in Cambodia remains good.
* Samdech Techo stated that through the re-assessment, it was found that Cambodia's economic growth is up to 7.5 percent.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that at any cost, the sovereignty and independence of the nation should not be exchanged for aid or any problem.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that even without additional income, Cambodia can afford to pay civil servants up to one year. Samdech added that only the revenue from customs duties is enough to pay the salaries of civil servants.
* Samdech Techo PM calls on workers not to worry about EBA as long as work remains.
* Samdech Techo confirmed that Cambodia will continue to host the Asia-Europe Meeting in 2020. The EBA issue does not affect Cambodian-European relations.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that there are only three countries that have preferential tariffs in ASEAN: Cambodia, Myanmar and Laos.
* Samdech Techo stated that Cambodia has many markets in the world, so Cambodia does not die because of the loss of any corner.
* The Prime Minister claimed that so far the Royal Government has controlled all situations.
* The Prime Minister stated that the payment of rice export tax to Europe, Cambodians living in Europe are also affected.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen called on all people to participate in the census in March.
