(Rattanakiri): Responding to the need for blood shortage to save lives, the Union of Youth Federations of Cambodia, Rattanakiri Province, civil servants, teachers and the three types of armed forces on the morning of February 14, 2019, which is the day of Love has volunteered to donate blood to Ratanakiri Provincial Referral Hospital to show and give love to each other.
