Finally, the US Congress approved a resolution to "withdraw America from the Yemeni war", but it needs another Senate ...
WASHINGTON (Reuters) - The US Congress has approved a resolution calling for the withdrawal of US troops from Yemen and the cessation of all support for Saudi-led military operations in the Middle East country. This is according to the press release from Sputnik on the morning of Thursday, February 14, 2019.
The US Congress, led by Democrats, passed the resolution Wednesday (US time) with 248 to 177 votes in favor. But the resolution requires the approval of the US Senate first, as Donald Trump's Republican Party holds a majority in the Senate.
If approved, it would require the administration of US President Donald Trump to withdraw all US troops from Yemen within 30 days. It will also end US military aid or support to the Saudi-led coalition operating in Yemen against the Iranian-backed Houthi rebels.
Earlier this week, US President Donald Trump also stated that he did not support the withdrawal of the United States from the war in Yemen because the United States only provided fuel to Saudi Arabia and provided some intelligence assistance. Also, do not join the fight with Saudi Arabia.
It should be noted that recently, Samdech Techo Hun Sen, the Prime Minister of Cambodia, wrote four poems with deep meanings and very surprising to readers.
The four-line poem of the head of the Royal Government, who is also a favorite writer, has caused a great deal of doubt as to the deep meaning embedded in this poem.
There is a saying that every action of every politician is not related to any political issue. For the above poem of Samdech Techo Hun Sen is also concluded to have a meaning related to political issues.
Political observers conclude that this poem is that Samdech Techo Hun Sen really intended to send a prisoner to flee Sam Rainsy district, as the bet between Samdech and this prisoner is close to the deadline on March 3, 2019.
Political observers have tried to interpret the above poem in this way.
The first phrase, "Do not cry, cross the river, brother, do not answer." Samdech Techo would like to emphasize that even though Sam Rainsy tried to do everything for Samdech to respond and respond, Samdech kept quiet and did not respond at all.
The third phrase, "My heart is broken because of my heart, my heart is black." In this sentence, Samdech Techo Hun Sen confirmed that Samdech no longer asked for pardon for Sam Rainsy, as he considered this prisoner to be a black man. Black heart because Samdech has already asked the King for forgiveness twice, but this prisoner is not only ungrateful, but also seriously insults the image of Samdech and his family.
The fourth phrase, "The bridge collapsed, the water was deep, how can it be done according to the contract?" In this sentence, Samdech Techo wants to highlight that there are many obstacles in front of Sam Rainsy, how to allow this prisoner to return home as he promised with his supporters.
The Minister also asked the Cambodian people to be united, tolerant, understanding and peaceful under the same umbrella of the Constitution.
Ministry of Education launches measures to prevent irregular activities on "Valentine's Day" in educational institutions
(Phnom Penh): The Ministry of Education, Youth and Sports has assigned public and private educational institutions to take some action to prevent irregular activities on "Valentine's Day" on February 14.
To prevent irregular activities on Valentine's Day, the Ministry of Education, Youth and Sports has provided educational institutions with the following activities:
1: Disseminate to students by all means, such as through meetings when saluting the flag, so as not to misunderstand the meaning of Valentine's Day.
2. Strengthen the implementation of the internal regulations of public educational institutions, especially on the management of ethics and discipline by monitoring the absence of students on a regular basis.
3: Promote the process of the Youth Council, the Children's Council of the school by implementing the "Friends of Friends" activities.
4: Liaise closely with parents, guardians, students of the community to provide and receive information related to irregular activities committed by students to cooperate in educating and guiding students in a timely manner.
In addition to instructing the Ministry to take action to prevent this unusual activity, the Ministry also confirmed that this day is not a traditional festival of the Cambodian people, and in recent years, Valentine's Day has become more and more influential. Let the youth forget their studies, lose their dignity and their families, and leave the beautiful culture and traditions of Cambodia.
On the morning of February 14, in the schools, it was observed that they acted in accordance with the instructions of the Ministry.
Ministry of Culture calls on people to use Valentine's Day on February 14 in accordance with the traditional path for honor and dignity
(Phnom Penh): The Ministry of Culture and Fine Arts has called on parents, guardians, relevant authorities at all levels, especially young people, to participate in educating, explaining, instructing and reminding their children to use "Valentine's Day" on February 14 in accordance with the traditional tradition of Khmer for the honor and dignity of the family, especially to contribute to the promotion of the prestige of the society.
At the call of the Ministry of Culture and Fine Arts, obtained by Fresh News, the ministry noted that February 14, which some people, especially Christians, have designated as Valentine's Day. Nowadays, this day has been penetrating into the Cambodian society, especially among the youth, causing some people to accept and use it in a confusing way, leading to an impact on the culture, traditions and customs of the nation.
The Ministry of Culture stated, "In this context, the people, especially the youth of Cambodia, must study and understand in depth the traditional culture, which is the precious heritage of our ancestors, as well as to fully understand the content and influence of culture and traditions from the outside. "Slip into the attitude and context of its society in order to maintain the existence of a noble nation that is thousands of years old in Asia."
Samdech Techo Hun Sen also expressed his happiness that a research report noted that young people now seem to be more mature compared to previous years' behavior on this Valentine's Day.
Samdech Techo Hun Sen also said that in fact, Samdech always wants to see workers have children and grandchildren happily, and happiness must come from the organization of a family in accordance with the law and Khmer traditions, other acts will not bring Happiness for both granddaughter and grandson.
Samdech Techo Hun Sen also encouraged young people to show their love and respect on February 14.
