Pursuant to Letter No. 0250 KOY SORVAN / 18 dated 13 February 2018 of the Ministry of Justice to the Prime Minister requesting the Ministry of Land Management, Urban Planning and Construction to seek the consent of 12 families and implement in accordance with A law to end a long-running dispute over the past 20 years.
