Strong economic growth of 7.7% over more than two decades, coupled with political stability, the distribution of the fruits of equitable prosperity, is fundamental to clearly explaining the noble choices of the Cambodian people who aspire to the path ahead. Peaceful and socio-economic development.
These appeals are merely provocative and inciting for the convict's ambition for power. The Royal Government will oppose by all means any attempt and intervention by third parties to destabilize and destroy the motherland as well as the happiness of our people. We will defend our nation against these tricks at all costs.
The Royal Government is properly elected, legally formed and officially recognized by many countries, including those in the European Union and other major democracies.
