(Phnom Penh): The nationwide traffic law enforcement campaign for February 9, 2019, the traffic police force inspected 6,036 vehicles, found 1,149 vehicles (motorcycles 56%), education 476 vehicles and park 673 fines, according to the official report of the Traffic Police and Public Order Department of the National Police.
According to the report, 3,238 helmets and goggles were inspected on February 9, 285 education helmets and 559 helmets were fined.
