The Director General of Immigration also urged the team to continue and make more efforts to monitor the presence of foreigners, especially urges the location owners, directors general of all locations must provide specific data on the number of foreigners staying and serving. The work is easy to manage and if there is still anonymity and non-specific information will be legally enforced.
