(Preah Vihear): The Governor of Preah Vihear Province of Cambodia, Mr. Un Chanda and the Governor of Ubon Ratchathani Province of Thailand, Mr. Sarith Vithoon, have vowed to solve the joint problem at An Sey to reach the opening of this international port in time. Coming soon.
This commitment was made during the negotiation meeting between the Governor of Preah Vihear and the Governor of Ubon at An Ses this morning, February 8, 2019.
Mr. Un Chanda said that he hoped that the two working groups would work hard to achieve success, bring development and development along the border, which really benefits the people. The relevant authorities cooperated and complied with the agreement as instructed by the two heads of government.
The provincial governor said that in the coming days, there will be a meeting between the interior ministers of the two countries. Therefore, in relation to the organization of order, the increase of good cooperation along the border, especially the An Sey checkpoint, is the leadership of the Ministries of Interior of the two countries and will be discussed further.
"Thus, the meetings between provinces and provinces, districts and districts, the army and the army have shown the strengthening of solidarity, good cooperation along the border to maintain a peaceful border for our two countries," he said.
At the same time, the provincial governor proposed four points to submit to the Ubon side to discuss joint solutions:
Point 1: The provincial governor urged the operation of An Se to become an international port, and for the opening of this international port is not related to the border posts, the border posts anywhere is the duty of the country's border commission. Therefore, at the provincial and provincial levels, efforts must be made to make An Sey an international port under the guidance of the two heads of government.
Point 2: The import of agricultural products and other goods that the two people sell in the markets of the two provinces, please follow the same as before, because the last period is limited to the import of goods and agricultural products of the people of Cambodia. Like the Thai people.
Point 3: Request Ubon Province to promote the implementation of border cards so that the people of the two countries can enter and leave legally.
Point 4: The Governor of Preah Vihear Province requested to create tasks for the narrow group at the provincial and provincial levels.
Mr. Un Chanda also expressed the hope that An Ses Port will be opened as an international port during the reign of Governor Sarith Vithun as the Governor of Ubon and he is the Governor of Preah Vihear. He said that we will both pave the way to the official launch.
He added that this story has passed through the governor of Preah Vihear province for a generation, while the governor of Ou Bun province has gone through a lot so far, so he hopes that his generation is the governor of Preah Vihear province and the generation of the governor of Ubon. An Sey will operate as an international port.
In response, the Thai Governor of Ubon Ratchathani agreed with the Governor of Preah Vihear Province and promised to jointly resolve the opening of the An Se International Airport in accordance with the instructions of the two heads of government. .
Cambodia Post Revenue Receives Over $ 13 Million in 2018
(Phnom Penh): Cambodia Post said that in 2018, it received more than 13 million US dollars, an increase of more than 50 percent compared to 2017.
Mr. Ok Bora, Director General of Cambodia Post, said that Cambodia Post has been actively receiving and distributing deposits to push the postal sector to be more efficient and progress in the international arena by partnering with local and foreign companies. Country.
He said that the needs of customers is the core mission of the management and staff of Cambodia Post at all levels, the main purpose is to serve the postal sector without racism, color or political tendencies in accordance with the rectangular strategy of the Royal Government in terms of promoting socio-economic growth and Contribute to reducing poverty by raising the living standards of employees.
He added that the results obtained by the post so far are very proud and indeed the results that contribute to the cooperation of the team, the management, the technical team, the customer service team with all customers and employees. Class. Therefore, they have to receive compensation in the form of salary increases and other benefits such as health care, bonuses and pensions.
