(Siem Reap): Electricite du Cambodge (EDC) said that at 12:30 noon on February 08, 2019, there was a case of high voltage 115 kV door diode at Siem Reap II substation (GS SR2) causing a power outage. Electricity in some areas is located in Banteay Srei district and the eastern part of Siem Reap city, Siem Reap province and Trapeang Prasat district, Oddar Meanchey province.
Electricite du Cambodge (EDC) confirmed that the cause was caused by workers at a private construction site throwing steel wire in contact with a 115 kV high voltage line.
