More than 820,000 international visitors to cross Bavet International Border Crossing in 2018
(Svay Rieng): Because Cambodia is peaceful, safe and secure, international guests have the confidence to come and go without any worries. In fact, when you look at the Bavet International Gate on the Cambodian-Vietnamese border, it is very busy to receive visitors every day. In 2018, 823,341 international visitors passed through this international gate with 161 nationalities.
Assistant Officer of Bavet International Border Gate, Svay Rieng Province, Mr. Puth Sothea Keo confirmed to Fresh News Agency that during the whole year 2018, Bavet International Border Gate has many national and international guests passing through to relax and visit the temples at various resorts. In Cambodia, there are 823,341 people with 161 nationalities.
The number of visitors to the casino and club in Bavet area was 429,589, most of whom were Vietnamese, Chinese, Korean, Filipino, Singaporean and other ethnic groups.
Mr. Puth Sothea Keo stated that the reason why the Bavet International Border Gate has more visitors is because the professional officers have carried out their joint responsibilities according to their skills by facilitating the guests well and on time, especially the gates are safe and hygienic. .
Please be informed that Svay Rieng is a province bordering Vietnam. The Royal Government of Cambodia has opened two international border gates: Bavet border gate in Bavet city and Prey Vor international border gate in Thmey commune, Kampong Ror district. Currently, the Prey Vor International Border Crossing does not have as many visitors as the Bavet International Border Crossing due to the unfavorable transportation routes and transportation of goods.
