Five days of jealousy, military officer, 393rd Battalion shot and killed his wife and himself
(Preah Vihear): Because of the fire of jealousy, it ignited the anger of the military officers in the 393rd Battalion, causing it to burn out and lose consciousness. Unexpected and outrageous incident occurred on the afternoon of February 3, 2019 in Battalion 393, Rong Roeung 1 Village, Teuk Krahorm Commune, Choam Ksan District, Preah Vihear Province. .
Brigadier General O Seng, Choam Ksan District Police Inspectorate, said that the cause of the violence was due to jealousy, which led to a small verbal dispute between the newlyweds for five days.
He said that after a verbal altercation, the husband grabbed an AK-47 assault rifle, fired two shots at the victim's wife, and died instantly.
After the incident, the authorities of Choam Ksan District Police Inspectorate inspected and autopsied the bodies of both spouses and concluded that they were indeed dead as described above, and handed over the bodies of both spouses to the family for cremation. According to their respective traditions.
