Ministry of Public Works and Transport 50% discount for heavy truck driving lessons, the remaining $ 175
(Phnom Penh): The Ministry of Public Works and Transport has decided to reduce the price by up to 50% for those who go to register to learn to drive a truck with a truck driving training center. The cost for learning to drive this heavy truck is only $ 175.
The decision to reduce this price is to encourage those who want to pursue a career as a heavy truck driver to learn to drive properly before they start this career. On the other hand, learning to drive a heavy truck will provide a legitimate job, gain accurate knowledge, which contributes to reducing traffic accidents and traffic congestion.
Heang Sotheayut, spokesman for the Ministry of Public Works and Transport, said the full tuition fee for the truck was $ 350. So far, only 20 people have registered under the concession, leaving 50.
Mr. Heang Sotheayut called on those who want to pursue a career as a truck driver to apply for driving lessons, as the Ministry does not currently allow other driving schools to teach truck driving.
It should be noted that the first heavy truck driving training center in Cambodia was officially inaugurated on Wednesday, October 31, 2018 under the chairmanship of Senior Minister Sun. Chanthol, Minister of Public Works and Transport. The center is located in the General Department of Road Transport, located on Street 598, Sangkat Chrang Chamres 2, Khan Russey Keo, Phnom Penh.
